        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) Upon return from a Leave of Absence for Union business an Employee shall be reinstated provided, however, that following the Employee's reinstatement he or she shall be subject to the provisions of Article 20, relating to termination of service due to lack of work.",
